  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att producera thermostable depolymerases fr&#xE5;n thermophilic mikroorganismer. 5-6 personer kommer att kunna disputera p&#xE5; detta material.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at producing thermostable depolymerases using thermophilic mircoorganisms. These will be isolated from local hot environmental niches and used in the enzyme production by fermentation. Further the cloning of the gene site directed  mutagenesis, gene expression will also be carried out to produce high amounts of the enzymes.</narrative>
  </description>
